  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 Northern California Winter Floods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As powerful winter storms unleashed pounding rain and strong winds across Northern California our team hit the ground to support the community in its time of need. The need for assistance is great.   This project will provide flood victims with the ability to obtain essential items such as food, water, clothing, and personal hygiene products. Additionally, we will support temporary housing solutions, such as hotel vouchers or the rental of apartments, for those who have lost their homes.</narrative>
  </description>
